  "overlaysNotDialogs": {
    "components/AchievementPopup.tsx": "A celebration, not a request. It interrupts without being asked, so the dialog contract is wrong for it: a focus trap would take the keyboard away from whatever the reader was doing, and Escape-to-dismiss implies a decision there is none. Named as not-a-dialog in Modal.tsx since 2026-08-23.",
    "components/Cruise/CruiseRouteMap.tsx": "The map's own full-screen edit mode, and it MUST stay in place: rendering the map a second time inside a modal is unmount + mount, maplibre throws its WebGL context away, and the fresh deck.gl layer meets a dead one — every layer dies with 'deck.gl: assertion failed'. Measured on 2026-08-26; it reached the RC server.",
    "components/Trips/PhotoLightbox.tsx": "An image viewer: full-bleed black, no title, no footer, and the picture is the content rather than something inside a panel. It is the one case that wants a bleed cut of the shell, which does not exist yet — so this entry is a gap to close, not a permanent exception.",
    "components/FlightForm/FlightLookupStep.tsx": "Not a dialog but a Suspense fallback: it covers the screen for the moment the scanner's lazy chunk is loading, and there is nothing to close, confirm or tab through. Giving it Escape would offer a way out of a wait that ends by itself, and a focus trap would hold the keyboard inside a spinner."
  }
